{"3908260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Beat of Rebellion", "steam_appid": 3908260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Let the Rhythm guide you</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Beat of Rebellion</strong>, you'll take the role of the <strong>Pulsedrifter</strong>, a young rebel who struggles to survive in a bleak future. Inside the<strong> cyberpunk metropolis </strong>of <strong>New Nexus</strong>, all forms of art are banned, artists are persecuted, and progress has suffocated the soul of humanity. Music is your ally, and the <strong>Beat </strong>is your weapon. Fight to bring back voice, color, and rhythm to a city cast into silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908260/extras/bd5ecd4853d0cc071b34e849903038af.poster.avif?t=1766248592\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908260/extras/bd5ecd4853d0cc071b34e849903038af.webm?t=1766248592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908260/extras/bd5ecd4853d0cc071b34e849903038af.mp4?t=1766248592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Beat your enemies with Melodies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beat of Rebellion</strong> blends a <strong>rhythmic game</strong> with the intensity of an isometric <strong>Hack &amp; Slash</strong>. Each battle unfolds in arenas where music dictates timing: the closer you time your actions to the <strong>Beat</strong>, the stronger you become!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the core of the combat system are <strong>Melodies</strong>: <strong>customizable combos</strong> where you assign the inputs, creating your own unique and <strong>rhythmicfighting</strong> style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908260/extras/8ec4a19c9a19cc493012de01017084b4.poster.avif?t=1766248592\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908260/extras/8ec4a19c9a19cc493012de01017084b4.webm?t=1766248592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908260/extras/8ec4a19c9a19cc493012de01017084b4.mp4?t=1766248592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover the Cyberpunk city of New Nexus</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through the <strong>Underbelly</strong> <strong>of New Nexus</strong>:<strong> three levels</strong>, each with its own environment and <strong>increasing BPM</strong>. Explore the Underbelly of <strong>New Nexus</strong>, overcome traps, hack gates, and dash over gaps while following the <strong>Beat</strong>. Follow the rhythm and dive into the city to meet its inhabitants and uncover its secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908260/extras/f951e4c93d2481712d906e4ef54e7e85.poster.avif?t=1766248592\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908260/extras/f951e4c93d2481712d906e4ef54e7e85.webm?t=1766248592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908260/extras/f951e4c93d2481712d906e4ef54e7e85.mp4?t=1766248592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Let the Rhythm guide you</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Beat of Rebellion</strong>, you'll take the role of the <strong>Pulsedrifter</strong>, a young rebel who struggles to survive in a bleak future. Inside the<strong> cyberpunk metropolis </strong>of <strong>New Nexus</strong>, all forms of art are banned, artists are persecuted, and progress has suffocated the soul of humanity. Music is your ally, and the <strong>Beat </strong>is your weapon. Fight to bring back voice, color, and rhythm to a city cast into silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908260/extras/bd5ecd4853d0cc071b34e849903038af.poster.avif?t=1766248592\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908260/extras/bd5ecd4853d0cc071b34e849903038af.webm?t=1766248592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908260/extras/bd5ecd4853d0cc071b34e849903038af.mp4?t=1766248592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Beat your enemies with Melodies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beat of Rebellion</strong> blends a <strong>rhythmic game</strong> with the intensity of an isometric <strong>Hack &amp; Slash</strong>. Each battle unfolds in arenas where music dictates timing: the closer you time your actions to the <strong>Beat</strong>, the stronger you become!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the core of the combat system are <strong>Melodies</strong>: <strong>customizable combos</strong> where you assign the inputs, creating your own unique and <strong>rhythmicfighting</strong> style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908260/extras/8ec4a19c9a19cc493012de01017084b4.poster.avif?t=1766248592\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908260/extras/8ec4a19c9a19cc493012de01017084b4.webm?t=1766248592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908260/extras/8ec4a19c9a19cc493012de01017084b4.mp4?t=1766248592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover the Cyberpunk city of New Nexus</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through the <strong>Underbelly</strong> <strong>of New Nexus</strong>:<strong> three levels</strong>, each with its own environment and <strong>increasing BPM</strong>. Explore the Underbelly of <strong>New Nexus</strong>, overcome traps, hack gates, and dash over gaps while following the <strong>Beat</strong>. Follow the rhythm and dive into the city to meet its inhabitants and uncover its secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908260/extras/f951e4c93d2481712d906e4ef54e7e85.poster.avif?t=1766248592\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908260/extras/f951e4c93d2481712d906e4ef54e7e85.webm?t=1766248592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908260/extras/f951e4c93d2481712d906e4ef54e7e85.mp4?t=1766248592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Be the voice out of the choir! Beat of Rebellion is an isometric rhythm-based Hack &am